00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
All artificial.

00:09.000 --> 00:10.333
No water.

00:10.333 --> 00:11.667
No light.

00:11.667 --> 00:13.000
No maintenance.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
And this? Also us.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Green walls for every space.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
Looks alive, 365 days a year.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
GreenTouch — installation nationwide.
